# Compose from system

If the change extends an existing flow or state and there is no Figma URL:

1. Do not call Figma MCP.
2. Copy structure from the nearest screen in `docs/ui/screens/` and that page's code.
3. Follow `docs/ui/recipes.md`. Reuse primitives from `docs/ui/components/index.md`.
4. Tokens only (`docs/ui/design-tokens.md`). New value → `system.ts` + tokens doc.
5. Mark new UI `composed` in `docs/ui/figma-nodes.md`.

If the user pastes a Figma node, or the surface has no sibling (e.g. Catalog E7), follow skill `vandrounik-ui`.
